From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sofian <sofianbll.x@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:34:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add Mac code-mod build support

Carry the code-patch subset of seedds/nxnative#883 on the NX2Apple pin. Parse IPSwitch, IPS and IPS32 files, apply matching build IDs after registered cuts and before rewriting, reject cuts and mod overlaps, and rewrite changed modules a second time. Accept full-line # comments used by released IPSwitch packs.

NX2Apple keeps its existing DM_ROMFS_OVERLAY. Only dm_code.tsv metadata is packed, and DM_MODS_OFF switches the shared code-mods copy on or off. Runtime RomFS scanning, mod env files and iOS embedding are intentionally not included.

Front-ends: build_ipa_from_nsp.py --mods is supported with --platform mac and mac-app. Set DM_MODS to staged metadata and DM_MODS_OFF to slash-separated disabled mod names.

Upstream-Status: forwarded seedds/nxnative#883
Reason: Carry the Mac code-mods subset with NX2Apple RomFS overlays until upstream merges it.
Issue: seedds/nxnative#883
