+## Code mods on the Mac
+
+When packing with `--platform mac` or `mac-app`, `--mods <folder>` builds ExeFS `.pchtxt`, IPS and IPS32 patches for this game version into the app. Code mods share one patched copy of the modules and switch on or off together through `DM_MODS_OFF`. Adding, removing or changing a code mod requires packing again. RomFS replacement files are not packed by this option and remain the front end's overlay. Replacement code modules and iOS code mods are not supported by this carry.
